function shelfHelp(){openModal(`<div class="modal-eyebrow">A LITTLE CALM. A REAL PUZZLE.</div><h2 class="modal-title" id="modal-title">Make the space work.</h2><div class="modal-art">${good(2)}${good(2)}${good(2)}</div><ol class="steps"><li><strong>Move between shelves.</strong> Tap a good, then an empty slot on another shelf, or drag it there. Three identical goods together on one shelf clear there.</li><li><strong>Think about what comes forward.</strong> Empty a shelf’s front row and its next row appears immediately. Those new goods use your free spaces. Tap “peek” to inspect the stock.</li><li><strong>Make the right match.</strong> A locked shelf shows the good that opens it. Match three of that good on any open shelf to release the lock.</li></ol><p class="modal-copy">There is no timer and no off-board basket. Sometimes you need several setup moves before a match is possible. Use empty spaces temporarily, then get them back.</p><p class="modal-copy">★ Solve the puzzle. ★ Finish without hints. ★ Meet the move target. Undo is free and returns the move count; using a hint stays recorded even if you undo. A target is a checked solution, not a proven minimum.</p><button class="primary-button" data-action="close">Let me think</button><button class="secondary-button" data-action="other-modes">Other ways to play</button>`);}
